<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>盤前情報準備台</title>

<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#F8FAFC">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="https://www.twse.com.tw/favicon.ico">
<script>
  if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
    navigator.serviceWorker.register('sw.js').catch(function(err) {
      console.log('SW register failed: ', err);
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg-page: #F8FAFC;
    --bg-card: #FFFFFF;
    --bg-sub: #F1F5F9;
    --bg-hover: #E2E8F0;
    --border: #E2E8F0;
    --border-strong: #CBD5E1;
    --text-main: #0F172A;
    --text-muted: #64748B;
    --text-light: #94A3B8;
    --rise: #E11D48;
    --fall: #16A34A;
    --amber: #D97706;
    --blue: #2563EB;
    --cat-fed: #E11D48;
    --cat-econ: #D97706;
    --cat-stock: #0284C7;
    --cat-futures: #D97706;
    --cat-gen: #64748B;
    --font-ui: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", "SF Pro Text", "Segoe UI", Roboto, "PingFang TC", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
    --font-mono: "SF Mono", "Consolas", Menlo, monospace;
    --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    --shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 1px 2px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg-page);
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
  }

  .font-mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .font-bold { font-weight: 600; }
  .rise { color: var(--rise) !important; }
  .fall { color: var(--fall) !important; }
  .amber { color: var(--amber) !important; }
  .blue { color: var(--blue) !important; }

  .page-wrap { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }

  /* HEADER */
  .page-header {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 18px 0;
  }
  .header-inner {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .meta-item {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .meta-label {
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-right: 4px;
  }
  .meta-val {
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .status-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .status-badge.is-ok {
    background: #F0FDF4;
    color: #15803D;
    border: 1px solid #BBF7D0;
  }
  .status-badge.is-warning {
    background: #FFF1F2;
    color: #BE123C;
    border: 1px solid #FECDD3;
  }

  /* NAV (Sticky Anchor Bar) */
  .page-nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 8px 0;
  }
  .nav-inner {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }
  .nav-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: transparent;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .nav-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-main);
    background: var(--bg-sub);
  }
  .nav-link.nav-alert {
    color: var(--rise);
  }
  .nav-badge {
    background: #FFE4E6;
    color: #BE123C;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  /* MAIN CONTENT */
  .page-main {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 24px 16px 64px;
  }
  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    scroll-margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-main);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .title-icon { font-size: 15px; }
  .section-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* SUMMARY SECTION */
  .summary-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .summary-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .summary-card.alert-highlight {
    border-color: #FECDD3;
    background: #FFF5F5;
  }
  .summary-card.alert-amber {
    border-color: #FDE68A;
    background: #FFFDF5;
  }
  .summary-card.alert-blue {
    border-color: #BFDBFE;
    background: #F8FAFF;
  }
  .card-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .card-val {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
  .card-val .unit {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-left: 2px;
  }
  .card-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .inst-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .chip {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .chip-label { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; }

  /* CARDS */
  .card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .card.alert-card-danger {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--rise);
  }
  .card.alert-card-amber {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--amber);
  }
  .card.alert-card-blue {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
  }
  .card-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .card-title-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .card-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
  .count-badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .count-badge.danger { background: #FFE4E6; color: #BE123C; }
  .count-badge.amber { background: #FEF3C7; color: #B45309; }
  .count-badge.blue { background: #EFF6FF; color: #1D4ED8; }
  .card-tip {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* DATA BLOCKS & TABLES */
  .data-block { width: 100%; }
  .table-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .table-scroll table { min-width: 600px; width: 100%; }
  .table-scroll.compact table { min-width: 360px; }

  .data-table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }
  .data-table th {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    background: #FAFBFD;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: left;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .data-table th.num { text-align: right; }
  .data-table td {
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9;
    vertical-align: middle;
    color: var(--text-main);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .data-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .data-table tr:hover td { background: #F8FAFC; }

  .data-table td.code { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; }
  .data-table td.name { color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; }
  .data-table td.num { text-align: right; }
  .data-table td.condition {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    max-width: 320px;
    white-space: normal;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  /* BADGES & DOTS */
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .badge-amber {
    border-color: #FCD34D;
    color: #B45309;
    background: #FEF3C7;
  }
  .badge-col { text-align: center !important; white-space: nowrap; }
  .badge-dots { display: flex; gap: 2px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .badge-dots .dot { width: 4px; height: 9px; background: #E2E8F0; border-radius: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .badge-dots .dot.filled { background: var(--amber); }
  .badge-frac { display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }

  /* EMPTY & META STATES */
  .empty-state {
    padding: 24px 16px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    background: #FAFBFD;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border);
  }
  .meta-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  /* ACCORDIONS (Details) */
  .unref-accordion {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }
  .unref-accordion:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .accordion-header {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: #FAFBFD;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    user-select: none;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
  .unref-accordion[open] .accordion-header {
    border-bottom-color: var(--border);
  }
  .accordion-content { padding: 10px; }
  .embed-frame {
    width: 100%;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }

  /* WATCHLIST / INSTITUTIONAL ACCORDION */
  .inst-accordion {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }
  .inst-accordion:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .inst-summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    user-select: none;
    background: #FAFBFD;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .inst-accordion[open] .inst-summary {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
  }
  .inst-tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .inst-code { color: var(--blue); }
  .inst-name { color: var(--text-main); }
  .inst-content { padding: 14px; }
  .dual-panel { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .dual-panel-col { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .sub-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  /* MARKET TILES */
  .tiles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .tile {
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .tile:hover {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  .tile .name {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .tile .sub-pill {
    font-size: 9px;
    background: #E2E8F0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 1px 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .tile .value {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
  .tile .delta {
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .tile .updated {
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .header-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .header-btn:hover {
    background: var(--bg-hover);
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  /* SUPPLEMENTARY (News & Calendar) */
  .supp-accordion {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .supp-summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .accordion-toggle-icon {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .supp-accordion[open] .accordion-toggle-icon {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .news-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .news-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .news-item:hover {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }
  .news-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .news-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .news-source { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; }

  /* CALENDAR */
  .cal-grid { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cal-grid-head, .cal-grid-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 4px; }
  .cal-grid-head { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .cal-grid-h { text-align: center; font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 0; }
  .cal-grid-row { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .cal-cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    padding: 4px 1px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .cal-cell.out { opacity: .35; }
  .cal-cell.today { border-color: var(--amber); background: #FFFBEB; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(217,119,6,0.2); }
  .cal-cell.has-events { cursor: pointer; }
  .cal-cell.has-events:hover { border-color: var(--blue); background: #FFFFFF; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .cal-cell-num { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500; }
  .cal-cell.today .cal-cell-num { color: var(--amber); font-weight: 700; }
  .cal-cell-dots { display: flex; gap: 2px; align-items: center; height: 4px; }
  .cal-cell-dots .dot { width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--amber); }
  .cal-cell-more { font-size: 8px; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); }

  .cal-agenda-scroll {
    max-height: 380px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding-right: 6px;
  }
  .cal-day {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    scroll-margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .cal-day:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .cal-date {
    flex: 0 0 65px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .cal-date.today { color: var(--amber); font-weight: 700; }
  .cal-day-events { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .cal-event-card {
    background: var(--bg-sub);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--cat-gen);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
  }
  .cal-event-card.cat-fed { border-left-color: var(--cat-fed); background: #FFF1F2; }
  .cal-event-card.cat-econ { border-left-color: var(--cat-econ); background: #FFFBEB; }
  .cal-event-card.cat-stock { border-left-color: var(--cat-stock); background: #F0F9FF; }
  .cal-event-card.cat-futures { border-left-color: var(--cat-futures); background: #FFFBEB; }

  .cal-header-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 2px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cal-time-pill { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 10px; background: #E2E8F0; color: #334155; font-weight: 600; }
  .cal-time-pill.all-day { background: #E2E8F0; color: #64748B; }
  .cal-cat-badge { font-size: 9px; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cat-fed .cal-cat-badge { background: #FFE4E6; color: #BE123C; }
  .cat-econ .cal-cat-badge { background: #FEF3C7; color: #B45309; }
  .cat-stock .cal-cat-badge { background: #E0F2FE; color: #0369A1; }
  .cat-futures .cal-cat-badge { background: #FEF3C7; color: #B45309; }
  .cat-general .cal-cat-badge { background: #F1F5F9; color: #475569; }
  .cal-summary { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main); }
  .cal-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 3px; white-space: pre-line; line-height: 1.4; }
  .cal-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; background: #FEF3C7; border: 1px solid #FDE68A; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; }

  /* FOOTER */
  .page-footer {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 32px 0 48px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
  .footer-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .footer-notes {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .footer-notes li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .footer-notes strong { color: var(--text-main); }
  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .tiles-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .dual-panel { flex-direction: column; }
    .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .cal-day { flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  }

  /* Responsive Mobile Card Layout for Disposal Table */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .disposal-table thead { display: none; }
    .disposal-table tbody tr {
      display: block;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
    }
    .disposal-table td {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 4px 0;
      border-bottom: none;
      white-space: normal;
      text-align: left !important;
    }
    .disposal-table td::before {
      content: attr(data-label);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .disposal-table .badge-dots {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
    .disposal-table .badge-frac {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 6px;
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="header-main">
        <h1 class="page-title">盤前情報準備台</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">產生時間</span> <span class="meta-val font-mono">{{ generated_at }}</span></span>
        {% if date_check and date_check.page_says_applies_to %}
        <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">資料日期</span> <span class="meta-val font-mono">{{ date_check.page_says_applies_to }}</span></span>
        {% endif %}
        <span class="meta-status">
          {% if date_check and date_check.applies_to_matches_today is sameas false %}
          <span class="status-badge is-warning" title="日期核對提醒：頁面顯示適用 {{ date_check.page_says_applies_to }}，但今天是 {{ date_check.today }}">日期待確認</span>
          {% elif date_check %}
          <span class="status-badge is-ok">資料已就緒</span>
          {% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- NAV (Sticky Anchor Bar) -->
  <nav class="page-nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="#summary" class="nav-link">今日摘要</a>
      {% set exiting_today = disposal.currently_in_disposal | rejectattr('trading_days_left', 'none') | selectattr('trading_days_left', 'in', ['0', '0天', 0, '出關']) | list %}
      {% set hidden_disposal = disposal.currently_in_disposal | selectattr('trading_days_left', 'none') | list %}
      {% set alert_total = (disposal.one_flag_from_disposal|length) + (exiting_today|length) %}
      <a href="#alerts" class="nav-link nav-alert">今日警示 {% if alert_total > 0 %}<span class="nav-badge">{{ alert_total }}</span>{% endif %}</a>
      <a href="#watchlist" class="nav-link">今日候選股</a>
      <a href="#market-context" class="nav-link">市場背景</a>
      <a href="#news-calendar" class="nav-link">補充資訊</a>
      <a href="#system-info" class="nav-link">系統資訊</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="page-main">

    <!-- 1. 摘要 (Summary) -->
    <section id="summary" class="content-section">
      <div class="summary-grid">
        <!-- 昨收大盤 -->
        {% if twse and twse.twii %}
        <div class="summary-card">
          <div class="card-label">昨收大盤</div>
          <div class="card-val font-mono {% if twse.twii.change > 0 %}rise{% elif twse.twii.change < 0 %}fall{% endif %}">
            {{ twse.twii.price }}
          </div>
          <div class="card-sub font-mono {% if twse.twii.change > 0 %}rise{% elif twse.twii.change < 0 %}fall{% endif %}">
            {% if twse.twii.change > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ twse.twii.change }} ({{ '%+.2f'|format(twse.twii.change_pct) }}%)
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 外資 / 投信 -->
        <div class="summary-card">
          <div class="card-label">三大法人買賣超</div>
          <div class="inst-chips font-mono">
            {% if twse.inst.foreign %}
            <div class="chip"><span class="chip-label">外資</span> <span class="{% if twse.inst.foreign > 0 %}rise{% else %}fall{% endif %}">{% if twse.inst.foreign > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ twse.inst.foreign }}億</span></div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if twse.inst.trust %}
            <div class="chip"><span class="chip-label">投信</span> <span class="{% if twse.inst.trust > 0 %}rise{% else %}fall{% endif %}">{% if twse.inst.trust > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ twse.inst.trust }}億</span></div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        <!-- 差1次處置 -->
        <div class="summary-card {% if disposal.one_flag_from_disposal|length > 0 %}alert-highlight{% endif %}">
          <div class="card-label">差 1 次處置</div>
          <div class="card-val font-mono {% if disposal.one_flag_from_disposal|length > 0 %}rise{% endif %}">
            {{ disposal.one_flag_from_disposal|length }} <span class="unit">檔</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-sub">盤中觸發即進入處置</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 今日出關 -->
        <div class="summary-card {% if exiting_today|length > 0 %}alert-amber{% endif %}">
          <div class="card-label">今日出關</div>
          <div class="card-val font-mono {% if exiting_today|length > 0 %}amber{% endif %}">
            {{ exiting_today|length }} <span class="unit">檔</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-sub">今日恢復正常撮合</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 市場未反映 -->
        {% set unref_count = (financials.att|length if financials.att else 0) + (financials.fin|length if financials.fin else 0) + (financials.rev|length if financials.rev else 0) %}
        <div class="summary-card {% if unref_count > 0 %}alert-blue{% endif %}">
          <div class="card-label">市場未反映公告</div>
          <div class="card-val font-mono {% if unref_count > 0 %}blue{% endif %}">
            {{ unref_count }} <span class="unit">筆</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-sub">{{ financials.cutoff_str or '昨日 13:30' }} 後公告</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 台指期夜盤 -->
        {% if night and night.latest %}
        <div class="summary-card">
          <div class="card-label">台指期夜盤 (05:00) · 來源：{{ night.latest.provider_name or night.provider_name or 'Yahoo' }}</div>
          {% if night.latest.is_fallback %}
          <div class="card-sub amber font-bold" style="font-size:10px; margin-bottom:2px;">⚠️ 抓取失敗，使用最近一次 fixtures/{{ night.date }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="card-val font-mono {% if night.latest.change > 0 %}rise{% elif night.latest.change < 0 %}fall{% endif %}">
            {{ "{:,.0f}".format(night.latest.price) if night.latest.price is not none else '—' }}
          </div>
          <div class="card-sub font-mono {% if night.latest.change > 0 %}rise{% elif night.latest.change < 0 %}fall{% endif %}">
            {% if night.latest.change is not none %}{% if night.latest.change > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ night.latest.change }} ({{ '%+.2f'|format(night.latest.change_pct) }}%){% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. 今日警示 (Alerts) -->
    <section id="alerts" class="content-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title"><span class="title-icon">🚨</span> 今日警示</h2>
        <span class="section-desc">開盤最直接影響操作的特定狀態標的</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 子區塊 1: 差1次就處置 -->
      <div class="card alert-card-danger">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title-group">
            <h3 class="card-title">差 1 次就處置</h3>
            <span class="count-badge danger">{{ disposal.one_flag_from_disposal|length }} 檔</span>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tip">若今日再達注意標準將預收款券或分盤撮合</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="data-block">
          {% if disposal.one_flag_from_disposal %}
          <div class="table-scroll">
            <table class="data-table disposal-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>市場</th>
                  <th>代號</th>
                  <th>名稱</th>
                  <th class="num">收盤</th>
                  <th>處置標準條件（估算）</th>
                  <th class="num">最快處置</th>
                  <th class="badge-col" title="連續3日第1款">3①</th>
                  <th class="badge-col" title="連續5日（第1~7款）">5</th>
                  <th class="badge-col" title="10日內6次（第1~7款）">6</th>
                  <th class="badge-col" title="30日內12次（第1~7款）">12</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for row in disposal.one_flag_from_disposal %}
                <tr>
                  <td data-label="市場">{{ row.market }}</td>
                  <td data-label="代號" class="code font-mono">{{ row.code }}</td>
                  <td data-label="名稱" class="name font-bold">{{ row.name }}</td>
                  <td data-label="收盤" class="num font-mono">{{ row.close }}</td>
                  <td data-label="處置條件" class="condition">{% if row.condition_segments %}{% for seg in row.condition_segments %}<span{% if seg.color %} style="color:{{ seg.color }}{{ ';font-weight:700' if seg.bold else '' }}"{% endif %}>{{ seg.text }}</span>{% endfor %}{% else %}{{ row.condition }}{% endif %}</td>
                  <td data-label="最快處置" class="num font-mono">
                    {% set ed_parts = row.earliest_disposal.split(' ', 1) %}
                    {% if ed_parts|length == 2 %}
                      <span>{{ ed_parts[0] }}</span>
                      <span class="badge badge-amber">{{ ed_parts[1] }}</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span>{{ row.earliest_disposal }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                  {% set badge_labels = ['3① 連3第1款', '5 連5第1~7款', '6 10日內6次', '12 30日內12次'] %}
                  {% for bd in row.badges or [{}, {}, {}, {}] %}
                  <td data-label="{{ badge_labels[loop.index0] }}" class="badge-col"{% if bd.title %} title="{{ bd.title }}"{% endif %}>
                    {% if bd.threshold %}
                    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center;">
                      <div class="badge-dots">{% for i in range(bd.threshold) %}<span class="dot{{ ' filled' if i < bd.current else '' }}"></span>{% endfor %}</div>
                      <span class="badge-frac font-mono">{{ bd.current }}/{{ bd.threshold }}</span>
                    </div>
                    {% else %}
                    <span class="badge-frac">—</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                  {% endfor %}
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="empty-state">今日無差 1 次即處置的標的</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 子區塊 2: 今日出關 -->
      <div class="card alert-card-amber">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title-group">
            <h3 class="card-title">今日出關</h3>
            <span class="count-badge amber">{{ exiting_today|length }} 檔</span>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tip">處置期滿恢復正常撮合機制</span>
        </div>

        <div class="data-block">
          {% if exiting_today %}
          <div class="table-scroll">
            <table class="data-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>市場</th>
                  <th>代號</th>
                  <th>名稱</th>
                  <th>原撮合</th>
                  <th class="num">處置起日</th>
                  <th class="num">處置迄日</th>
                  <th class="num">出關日</th>
                  <th>狀態</th>
                  <th>處置原因</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for row in exiting_today %}
                <tr>
                  <td>{{ row.market }}</td>
                  <td class="code font-mono">{{ row.code }}</td>
                  <td class="name font-bold">{{ row.name }}</td>
                  <td>{{ row.matching }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono">{{ row.start_date }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono">{{ row.end_date }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono amber font-bold">{{ row.exit_date }}</td>
                  <td><span class="badge badge-amber">今日出關</span></td>
                  <td class="condition">{{ row.reason }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="empty-state">今日無處置出關標的</div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if hidden_disposal|length > 0 %}
          <!-- 隱藏 {{ hidden_disposal|length }} 筆（資料缺欄位，請回報） -->
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 子區塊 3: 市場未反映 -->
      <div class="card alert-card-blue">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title-group">
            <h3 class="card-title">市場未反映公告</h3>
            <span class="count-badge blue">{{ unref_count }} 筆</span>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tip">自結、季報、營收 ({{ financials.cutoff_str or '昨日 13:30' }} 後首次公告)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="data-block">
          <details class="unref-accordion" open>
            <summary class="accordion-header">即時自結（市場未反映 {{ financials.att|length if financials.att else 0 }} 筆）</summary>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <iframe src="embed/att.html" class="embed-frame" style="height:320px;"></iframe>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="unref-accordion" open>
            <summary class="accordion-header">即時季報（市場未反映 {{ financials.fin|length if financials.fin else 0 }} 筆）</summary>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <iframe src="embed/fin.html" class="embed-frame" style="height:320px;"></iframe>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="unref-accordion" open>
            <summary class="accordion-header">即時營收（市場未反映 {{ financials.rev|length if financials.rev else 0 }} 筆）</summary>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <iframe src="embed/rev.html" class="embed-frame" style="height:320px;"></iframe>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. 今日候選股 (Watchlist) -->
    <section id="watchlist" class="content-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title"><span class="title-icon">🎯</span> 今日候選股</h2>
        <span class="section-desc">盤前族群整理、法人動向與主力當沖籌碼明細</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 族群聚焦標的 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title-group">
            <h3 class="card-title">族群聚焦標的</h3>
            <span class="count-badge">{{ pressplay.found_group.matched|length }} 檔</span>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tip">已比對 {{ pressplay.found_group.raw_tokens|length }} 檔，共 {{ pressplay.found_group.matched|length }} 檔具明確族群連動</span>
        </div>

        <div class="data-block">
          {% if pressplay.found_group.matched %}
          <div class="table-scroll">
            <table class="data-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>市場</th>
                  <th>代號</th>
                  <th>名稱</th>
                  <th class="num">收盤</th>
                  <th class="num">量(張)</th>
                  <th class="num">外資(張)</th>
                  <th class="num">投信(張)</th>
                  <th class="num">自營(張)</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for row in pressplay.found_group.matched %}
                <tr>
                  <td>{{ row.market }}</td>
                  <td class="code font-mono">{{ row.code }}</td>
                  <td class="name font-bold">{{ row.name }}{% if row.match_type == 'fuzzy_name' %} <span class="badge" title="原文：{{ row.raw_token }}">模糊比對</span>{% endif %}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono">{{ row.close }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono">{{ row.volume }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono {% if row.foreign and '+' in row.foreign %}rise{% elif row.foreign and '-' in row.foreign %}fall{% endif %}">{{ row.foreign }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono {% if row.trust and '+' in row.trust %}rise{% elif row.trust and '-' in row.trust %}fall{% endif %}">{{ row.trust }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono {% if row.dealer and '+' in row.dealer %}rise{% elif row.dealer and '-' in row.dealer %}fall{% endif %}">{{ row.dealer }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="empty-state">今日無具明確族群標的</div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if pressplay.found_group.unmatched %}
          <div class="meta-note">未比對到之原文標記：{{ pressplay.found_group.unmatched|join('、') }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 無明確族群但有異動標的 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title-group">
            <h3 class="card-title">無明確族群標的</h3>
            <span class="count-badge">{{ pressplay.not_found_group.matched|length }} 檔</span>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tip">已比對 {{ pressplay.not_found_group.raw_tokens|length }} 檔，共 {{ pressplay.not_found_group.matched|length }} 檔為個股題材或獨立動能</span>
        </div>

        <div class="data-block">
          {% if pressplay.not_found_group.matched %}
          <div class="table-scroll">
            <table class="data-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>市場</th>
                  <th>代號</th>
                  <th>名稱</th>
                  <th class="num">收盤</th>
                  <th class="num">量(張)</th>
                  <th class="num">外資(張)</th>
                  <th class="num">投信(張)</th>
                  <th class="num">自營(張)</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for row in pressplay.not_found_group.matched %}
                <tr>
                  <td>{{ row.market }}</td>
                  <td class="code font-mono">{{ row.code }}</td>
                  <td class="name font-bold">{{ row.name }}{% if row.match_type == 'fuzzy_name' %} <span class="badge" title="原文：{{ row.raw_token }}">模糊比對</span>{% endif %}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono">{{ row.close }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono">{{ row.volume }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono {% if row.foreign and '+' in row.foreign %}rise{% elif row.foreign and '-' in row.foreign %}fall{% endif %}">{{ row.foreign }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono {% if row.trust and '+' in row.trust %}rise{% elif row.trust and '-' in row.trust %}fall{% endif %}">{{ row.trust }}</td>
                  <td class="num font-mono {% if row.dealer and '+' in row.dealer %}rise{% elif row.dealer and '-' in row.dealer %}fall{% endif %}">{{ row.dealer }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="empty-state">今日無獨立動能標的</div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if pressplay.not_found_group.unmatched %}
          <div class="meta-note">未比對到之原文標記：{{ pressplay.not_found_group.unmatched|join('、') }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 個股法人買賣與當沖明細 -->
      {% if institutional.stocks %}
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title-group">
            <h3 class="card-title">焦點股券商分點與當沖明細</h3>
            <span class="count-badge">{{ institutional.matched_count }} 檔</span>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tip">涵蓋焦點清單中具分點進出資料之標的</span>
        </div>

        <div class="data-block">
          {% for item in institutional.stocks %}
          <details class="inst-accordion">
            <summary class="inst-summary">
              <span class="inst-tag">{{ item.market }}</span>
              <span class="inst-code font-mono">{{ item.code }}</span>
              <span class="inst-name font-bold">{{ item.name }}</span>
              <span class="inst-chips font-mono" style="margin-left:auto; display:flex; flex-direction:row; gap:8px;">
                <span>外資 {{ item.foreign }}</span>
                <span>投信 {{ item.trust }}</span>
                <span>自營 {{ item.dealer }}</span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            
            <div class="inst-content">
              <div class="dual-panel">
                <div class="dual-panel-col">
                  <div class="sub-label">買超 Top 15 分點</div>
                  <div class="table-scroll compact">
                    <table class="data-table">
                      <thead><tr><th>券商分點</th><th class="num">買超</th><th class="num">買均</th><th class="num">買張</th><th class="num">賣張</th><th class="num">賣均</th></tr></thead>
                      <tbody>
                        {% for r in item.buyers %}
                        <tr>
                          <td class="name">{{ r.name }}</td>
                          <td class="num rise font-mono">{{ r.net }}</td>
                          <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.buyP }}</td>
                          <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.buyV }}</td>
                          <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.sellV }}</td>
                          <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.sellP }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% else %}
                        <tr class="empty-row"><td colspan="6">無買超分點資料</td></tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="dual-panel-col">
                  <div class="sub-label">賣超 Top 15 分點</div>
                  <div class="table-scroll compact">
                    <table class="data-table">
                      <thead><tr><th>券商分點</th><th class="num">賣超</th><th class="num">買均</th><th class="num">買張</th><th class="num">賣張</th><th class="num">賣均</th></tr></thead>
                      <tbody>
                        {% for r in item.sellers %}
                        <tr>
                          <td class="name">{{ r.name }}</td>
                          <td class="num fall font-mono">{{ r.net }}</td>
                          <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.buyP }}</td>
                          <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.buyV }}</td>
                          <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.sellV }}</td>
                          <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.sellP }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% else %}
                        <tr class="empty-row"><td colspan="6">無賣超分點資料</td></tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="margin-top:14px;">
                <div class="sub-label">當沖 Top 10 分點</div>
                <div class="table-scroll">
                  <table class="data-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>券商分點</th><th class="num">當沖總量</th><th class="num">買張</th><th class="num">買均</th><th class="num">賣張</th><th class="num">賣均</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                      {% for r in item.daytraders %}
                      <tr>
                        <td class="name">{{ r.name }}</td>
                        <td class="num font-mono font-bold">{{ r.total }}</td>
                        <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.buyV }}</td>
                        <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.buyP }}</td>
                        <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.sellV }}</td>
                        <td class="num font-mono">{{ r.sellP }}</td>
                      </tr>
                      {% else %}
                      <tr class="empty-row"><td colspan="6">無當沖分點資料</td></tr>
                      {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </section>

    <!-- 4. 市場背景 (Market Context) -->
    <section id="market-context" class="content-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title"><span class="title-icon">🌐</span> 市場背景</h2>
        <span class="section-desc">美股收盤、跨海連動 ADR 與亞股早盤概況</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 美股四大指數 & 跨海連動 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title-group">
            <h3 class="card-title">美股四大指數與跨海連動標的</h3>
          </div>
          <a href="https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/markets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="header-btn">Yahoo 股市 ↗</a>
        </div>

        <div class="data-block">
          <!-- 美股四大指數 (Row 1) -->
          <div class="tiles-grid">
            {% for key, tile in us_indices.items() %}
            {% if tile %}
            <div class="tile">
              <div class="name">{{ tile.name }}</div>
              <div class="value font-mono">{{ '{:,.2f}'.format(tile.value) }}</div>
              <div class="delta font-mono {{ 'rise' if tile.change_pct >= 0 else 'fall' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(tile.change) }} ({{ '%+.2f'|format(tile.change_pct) }}%)</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>

          <!-- 跨海連動 / ADR (Row 2) -->
          <div class="tiles-grid" style="margin-top:10px;">
            {% if night and night.latest %}
            <div class="tile">
              <div class="name"><span>台指期夜盤</span> <span class="sub-pill">05:00 · 來源：{{ night.latest.provider_name or night.provider_name or 'Yahoo' }}</span></div>
              {% if night.latest.is_fallback %}
              <div class="amber font-bold font-mono" style="font-size:9px; margin-bottom:2px;">⚠️ 抓取失敗，使用最近一次 fixtures/{{ night.date }}</div>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="value font-mono">{{ "{:,.0f}".format(night.latest.price) if night.latest.price is not none else '—' }}</div>
              <div class="delta font-mono {{ 'rise' if night.latest.change >= 0 else 'fall' }}">{% if night.latest.change is not none %}{{ '%+.0f'|format(night.latest.change) }} ({{ '%+.2f'|format(night.latest.change_pct) }}%){% endif %}</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if indices and indices.adrs and indices.adrs.tsmc %}
            <div class="tile">
              <div class="name">{{ indices.adrs.tsmc.name }}</div>
              <div class="value font-mono">{{ '{:,.2f}'.format(indices.adrs.tsmc.value) }}</div>
              <div class="delta font-mono {{ 'rise' if indices.adrs.tsmc.change_pct >= 0 else 'fall' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(indices.adrs.tsmc.change) }} ({{ '%+.2f'|format(indices.adrs.tsmc.change_pct) }}%)</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if indices and indices.adrs and indices.adrs.umc %}
            <div class="tile">
              <div class="name">{{ indices.adrs.umc.name }}</div>
              <div class="value font-mono">{{ '{:,.2f}'.format(indices.adrs.umc.value) }}</div>
              <div class="delta font-mono {{ 'rise' if indices.adrs.umc.change_pct >= 0 else 'fall' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(indices.adrs.umc.change) }} ({{ '%+.2f'|format(indices.adrs.umc.change_pct) }}%)</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if indices and indices.adrs and indices.adrs.ase %}
            <div class="tile">
              <div class="name">{{ indices.adrs.ase.name }}</div>
              <div class="value font-mono">{{ '{:,.2f}'.format(indices.adrs.ase.value) }}</div>
              <div class="delta font-mono {{ 'rise' if indices.adrs.ase.change_pct >= 0 else 'fall' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(indices.adrs.ase.change) }} ({{ '%+.2f'|format(indices.adrs.ase.change_pct) }}%)</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 日股 / 韓股 開盤走勢 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title-group">
            <h3 class="card-title">亞股開盤走勢</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tip">08:00 開盤行情</span>
        </div>

        <div class="data-block">
          <div class="tiles-grid">
            {% for key, tile in asia_open.items() %}
            {% if tile %}
            <div class="tile">
              <div class="name">{{ tile.name }}</div>
              <div class="value font-mono">{{ '{:,.2f}'.format(tile.value) }}</div>
              <div class="delta font-mono {{ 'rise' if tile.change_pct >= 0 else 'fall' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(tile.change) }} ({{ '%+.2f'|format(tile.change_pct) }}%)</div>
              {% if tile.updated_cst %}<div class="updated font-mono">{{ tile.updated_cst }}</div>{% endif %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% if indices_missing %}
          <div class="meta-note">缺少欄位：{{ indices_missing|join('、') }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. 補充資訊 (News & Calendar) -->
    <section id="news-calendar" class="content-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title"><span class="title-icon">📑</span> 補充資訊</h2>
        <span class="section-desc">隔夜市場焦點新聞與近期總經行事曆</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 隔夜重大新聞 (可折疊) -->
      {% if news %}
      <div class="card">
        <details class="supp-accordion" open>
          <summary class="supp-summary">
            <div class="card-title-group">
              <h3 class="card-title">隔夜重大新聞 Top 5</h3>
              <span class="count-badge">{{ news|length }} 則</span>
            </div>
            <span class="accordion-toggle-icon">▼</span>
          </summary>
          
          <div class="supp-content" style="margin-top:14px;">
            <div class="news-list">
              {% for a in news %}
              <a href="{{ a.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="news-item">
                <div class="news-title">{{ a.title }}</div>
                <div class="news-meta font-mono">
                  <span class="news-source">{{ a.source }}</span>
                  <span class="news-time">{{ a.time }}</span>
                </div>
              </a>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- 財經行事曆 (可折疊) -->
      <div class="card">
        <details class="supp-accordion" open>
          <summary class="supp-summary">
            <div class="card-title-group">
              <h3 class="card-title">財經行事曆</h3>
              <span class="count-badge">{{ calendar.events|length }} 筆事件</span>
            </div>
            <span class="accordion-toggle-icon">▼</span>
          </summary>

          <div class="supp-content" style="margin-top:14px;">
            {% if calendar.grid %}
            <div class="cal-grid">
              <div class="cal-grid-head">
                {% for wl in calendar.grid.weekday_labels %}<div class="cal-grid-h">{{ wl }}</div>{% endfor %}
              </div>
              {% for week in calendar.grid.weeks %}
              <div class="cal-grid-row">
                {% for d in week %}
                {% if d.count %}
                <a class="cal-cell has-events{{ ' today' if d.is_today else '' }}" href="#cal-{{ d.date }}">
                  <span class="cal-cell-num">{{ d.month_label or d.day }}</span>
                  <span class="cal-cell-dots">{% for i in range([d.count, 3]|min) %}<span class="dot"></span>{% endfor %}{% if d.count > 3 %}<span class="cal-cell-more">+{{ d.count - 3 }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
                </a>
                {% else %}
                <div class="cal-cell{{ ' today' if d.is_today else '' }}{{ '' if d.in_range else ' out' }}">
                  <span class="cal-cell-num">{{ d.month_label or d.day }}</span>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if calendar.events %}
            <div class="cal-agenda-scroll">
              {% for date, evs in calendar.events|groupby('date') %}
              <div class="cal-day" id="cal-{{ date }}">
                <div class="cal-date{{ ' today' if date == calendar.today else '' }}">
                  {{ date[5:].replace('-', '/') }}
                  {% if date == calendar.today %}<br><span class="badge badge-amber">今天</span>{% endif %}
                </div>
                <div class="cal-day-events">
                  {% for ev in evs %}
                  <div class="cal-event-card cat-{{ ev.category or 'general' }}">
                    <div class="cal-header-row">
                      {% if ev.time %}
                      <span class="cal-time-pill">{{ ev.time }}</span>
                      {% else %}
                      <span class="cal-time-pill all-day">全天</span>
                      {% endif %}
                      <span class="cal-cat-badge">{{ ev.category_name or '事件' }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cal-summary">{{ ev.summary }}</div>
                    {% if ev.description %}<div class="cal-desc">{{ ev.description }}</div>{% endif %}
                    {% if ev.mm_link %}
                    <div>
                      <a class="cal-link" href="{{ ev.mm_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📊 MM 圖表連結 ↗</a>
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% else %}
            <div class="empty-state">近期無排定事件</div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- 6. 系統資訊 (System Info Footer) -->
  <footer id="system-info" class="page-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-title">系統與資料說明</div>
      <ul class="footer-notes">
        <li><strong>資料來源：</strong>處置股與財務公告來自 chengwaye.com；籌碼股來自 PressPlay 每日盤前專欄；指數報價來自 Yahoo Finance；新聞聚合來自 Google News；財經行事曆來自 MacroMicro。</li>
        <li><strong>排程機制：</strong>交易日每日 07:35（美股收盤與早報結算）、08:05（日韓開盤走勢）、08:20（台指期開盤前最後確認）自動更新。</li>
        <li><strong>欄位說明：</strong>個股當沖明細原「總損益」欄位因公開資料無法可靠推算，為確保數據精準故不予顯示。</li>
        <li><strong>資料範圍：</strong>法人買賣與當沖明細僅涵蓋當日 28 檔重點清單；未在清單內之標的自動略過。</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="footer-copy">盤前情報準備台 · 自用盤前決策工作台</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
